<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Wardrobe styling · New York</p>
    <h1>Dressed like <em>yourself</em>, only more so.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Halie blends custom, vintage, and street fashion into looks that reflect who you already are. Closet edits, personal shopping, event styling, and a fresh eye on what you own.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="#contact">Book a consult</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#services">See the services</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Services</h2>
    <p class="note">Placeholder. Halie's copy and pricing go here.</p>
    <div class="services">
      <div><h3>Closet edit</h3><p>Two to three hours in your closet. What stays, what goes, what's missing, and twenty outfits you didn't know you had.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Personal shopping</h3><p>Vintage, custom, and new, sourced to a list we build together. In person or from a curated pull sent to you.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Event styling</h3><p>One look, one occasion, from the invitation to the door. Weddings, galas, shoots, and the nights that matter.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Seasonal refresh</h3><p>A standing edit each season so the wardrobe keeps up with your life without a full rebuild.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band dark" id="reels">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>From the feed</h2><a href="{{ site.instagram }}">@urbansophisticatecollective</a></div>
    <div class="reels">
    {%- for r in reels %}
      <figure>
        <video controls preload="none" poster="{{ r.poster }}" playsinline><source src="{{ r.src }}" type="video/mp4"></video>
        <figcaption><strong>{{ r.title }}</strong><br>{{ r.note }}</figcaption>
      </figure>
    {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="note" style="margin-top:1.5rem">Placeholder reel, cropped from Instagram. The originals replace these before launch.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="about">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="photo-placeholder">Photo of Halie</div>
    <div>
      <h2>Halie</h2>
      <p class="lede">Lead wardrobe consultant. Halie's styling began years ago out of a love of fashion and an eye for what makes a person look like themselves.</p>
      <p class="note">Placeholder. Halie's bio arrives with the photos.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band dark" id="contact">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div>
      <h2>Start with a conversation.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Tell Halie what you're dressing for and what's not working. She'll come back with a plan.</p>
    </div>
    <form class="form" action="https://formsubmit.co/{{ site.email }}" method="POST">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Consult request from the website">
      <label>Name <input type="text" name="name" required></label>
      <label>Email <input type="email" name="email" required></label>
      <label>What are you dressing for? <textarea name="message" rows="4"></textarea></label>
      <button class="btn" type="submit">Send</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
